	"notice": "Select the matching hardware port. The original Windows port name is 2- Control Surface. MIDI is forwarded into this chain; use a MIDI device output to send commands back to the hardware. Custom MIDI assignments depend on the K-Mix configuration. Surface mappings are virtual defaults; use MIDI learn to match your hardware MIDI bank or expander device. Configurable surface controls use virtual defaults; match your hardware preset with MIDI learn or edit note/CC/channel mappings. Keyboard surfaces start at MIDI note 48.",
